            "review_text": "Khamry K\n7 contributions\n0\nGreat restaurant\nDec 2025 • Couples\nThis quaint restaurant run by a family is delicious. We had two bowls of pho and were impressed. The pho ga (chicken) was tender and delicious. My Vietnamese ice coffee was also refreshing and delicious. I highly recommend coming here in Tam Coc after a long day of tours and sightseeing.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 29, 2025",
